{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"前一段的昂扬像慢慢退潮，他忍不住自问：【我刚才是真的相信那些话】，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"source\":\"也可以听成：如果换一种感受，这里不像重新获得活力，更像前一段的昂扬正在慢慢退潮。音乐变得流动、含蓄、若有所思，仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿只是提供一种可能的音乐听法，用“仿佛”呈现自问，屏幕稿却明确写成他忍不住这样想，变成了确定的人物心理。\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"不是已经想通了，而是抵抗得累了\",\"source\":\"这一下松动，也像是“不是已经想通了，而是抵抗得累了”。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将抵抗疲惫作为一种可能的听法，屏幕稿删掉“也像是”，把这种猜测写成了确定判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"一个熟悉的动作、一次舞蹈、一段曾经习以为常的生活突然闯进来\",\"source\":\"另一个可以同时浮现的联想，是一种非常具体、非常生活化的记忆突然闯进深沉的感受里：一个熟悉的动作、一次舞蹈、一段曾经习以为常的生活。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿说的是听者可能浮现的一种联想，屏幕稿却把它接入人物经历，写成他确实突然想起了这些具体的旧事。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "66ed21ea-d39f-49aa-962f-3131f1e83fcc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T055709990171Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T05:58:27.752688+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "50abfba979ef036aa1e36fa019e731e2f822c1fae319b9e79c56e4c58c064097", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_a